  "~dozens of seeds under-determine the rotation; the self-learning bootstrap does the heavy lifting (Artetxe 2017 precedent).",
  "Model-selection caveat: default config (PCA dim, seed threshold) was chosen while gold diagnostics were visible; the witness fails the gate under every config tried, so the leak cannot have manufactured a qualification — but re-verify on a frozen config if it ever nears the bar.",
  "By count only ~half the seeds are solid (hand-audit in ml/README.md): the low-weight tail holds referent mismatches (Saul the king vs Saulos of Tarsus) and phonetic coincidences (Gomer/Gomorrha). Kept deliberately — hand-pruning would re-admit an editor into a witness whose value is owing nothing to one; log-frequency weighting makes the solid anchors the majority by weight and robust IRLS downweights persistent outliers.",
  "Rare words have noisy vectors: thinEvidence disbelief is weak evidence.",
  "Hubness is CSLS-corrected, not eliminated.",
  "A general non-proper-name phonetic tier was tried and REJECTED: chance false cognates dominate at any usable threshold (e.g. shoter 'officer' ~ soter 'saviour')."
 ],
